{"page":87,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:52","surah":4,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَعَنَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ ۖ وَمَن يَلْعَنِ ٱللَّهُ فَلَن تَجِدَ لَهُۥ نَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those are the ones God has rejected: you [Prophet] will not find anyone to help those God has rejected.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَعَنَهُمُ","en_gloss":"(who have been) cursed","transliteration":"laʿanahumu","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَلْعَنِ","en_gloss":"(is) cursed","transliteration":"yalʿani","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلَن","en_gloss":"then never","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَجِدَ","en_gloss":"will you find","transliteration":"tajida","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نَصِيرًا","en_gloss":"(any) helper","transliteration":"naṣīran","verse_key":"4:52"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥٢","en_gloss":"(52)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:52"}]},{"verse_key":"4:53","surah":4,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ لَهُمْ نَصِيبٌ مِّنَ ٱلْمُلْكِ فَإِذًا لَّا يُؤْتُونَ ٱلنَّاسَ نَقِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they have any share of what He possesses? If they did they would not give away so much as the groove of a date stone.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"4:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"4:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَصِيبٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a share","transliteratio